            "From and Through dates bound the request",
            "The disclosure purpose is stated",
            "The recipient and secure endpoint are confirmed",
            "The secure delivery method is selected"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "record_categories",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Record categories requested",
          "items": [
